Het CoRW2-gc-sys-acqrel-2s
"Heterogeneous CoRW2-gc-sys-acqrel-2s: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA)"
{
1:X0=x;
}
 P0:gpu              | P1:cpu       ;
 r[acquire,sys] r0 x | MOV W1,#2    ;
 w[release,sys] x 1  | STLR W1,[X0] ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P0)))
exists (0:r0=2 /\ [x]=2)
